&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Development Representative for Japan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;, you will support Dropbox’s Japan Sales organization by generating qualified pipeline, engaging target accounts, and helping Account Executives create new enterprise opportunities across Dropbox Business Enterprise,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Dropbox &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-16z86ztz122z98z81zz82zz85zunv3z82zpqfnlan30z80z2wz89zz87zd3z77zz76zz72zz83ziz77zz69zpz82zvlm61m6g&quot;&gt;Protect and AI solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;You will play a crucial role in areas such as outbound prospecting, account research, stakeholder mapping, inbound qualification, event follow-up, and partner-supported pipeline generation. You will work closely with Account Executives to identify relevant business challenges, engage the right personas, and create clear handoffs that help move qualified opportunities into the sales cycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is curious, resilient, highly organized, and motivated by creating opportunity. You will gain exposure to enterprise sales cycles, AI-enabled workplace transformation, content collaboration, security and governance conversations, and senior sales stakeholders. This is a strong development opportunity for someone looking to grow into a future &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85z92z122zz90zdz68zz74z6kz89z6rz76zsfz66z3nz68zz76zfz82z3z89z0z89zz122zz74zn&quot;&gt;Account Executive role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Generate qualified pipeline for Japan Account Executives through outbound prospecting, account research, personalized email, phone outreach, social selling, events, and partner motions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-697873163614276687198764 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-697873163614276687198764-first author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;Follow up promptly with attendees from Dropbox-hosted seminars, webinars and other events while their interest is still fresh improving conversion from MQLs to sales-qualified opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Identify and engage new buying centers within target and existing accounts, including IT, Security, Compliance, Operations, Procurement, and Line-of-Business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Research target accounts to understand business priorities, trigger events, pain points, and relevant Dropbox use cases across Dropbox Business Enterprise, Dash, and Replay.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Partner with Account Executives to build account maps, prioritize outreach, support territory planning, and create multi-threaded engagement strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Conduct initial discovery with prospects to understand collaboration, content management, security, governance, AI, and workflow challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Qualify opportunities based on business pain, stakeholder fit, urgency, timing, use case, and potential revenue impact, then create clear handoffs to Account Executives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate account, contact, activity, and opportunity data in Salesforce or equivalent CRM, while sharing customer insights, objections, and market feedback with cross-functional teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-16z86ztz122z98z81zz82zz85zunv3z82zpqfnlan30z80z2wz89zz87zd3z77zz76zz72zz83ziz77zz69zpz82zvlm61m6g&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-749814359338015535842630 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-749814359338015535842630-first author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;+ years of B2B sales, business development, sales development, lead generation in a SaaS, technology, or a consultative sales environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to generate interest through outbound prospecting, including personalized email, phone outreach, social selling, events, or account-based campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to tailor messaging to different customer personas, business priorities, and levels of seniority.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Strong curiosity and discovery skills, with the ability to ask thoughtful questions and connect customer challenges to potential Dropbox value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;High level of organization and follow-through, including accurate CRM hygiene, activity tracking, timely prospect follow-up, and clear AE handoffs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85z92z122zz90zdz68zz74z6kz89z6rz76zsfz66z3nz68zz76zfz82z3z89z0z89zz122zz74zn&quot;&gt;Fluent &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-037700206905612934663338 attrcomment attrcommentfirst thread-037700206905612934663338-first author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;Japanese&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-037700206905612934663338 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85z92z122zz90zdz68zz74z6kz89z6rz76zsfz66z3nz68zz76zfz82z3z89z0z89zz122zz74zn&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt; is required. B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-037700206905612934663338 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;usiness-level English &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-037700206905612934663338 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85z92z122zz90zdz68zz74z6kz89z6rz76zsfz66z3nz68zz76zfz82z3z89z0z89zz122zz74zn&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;fluency is preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-037700206905612934663338 attrcomment author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-extra-inner-span&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90za3wz122zz77zjz88zx7z66zz78zz69zbz70znpvz79z6z87z9z90zxz81zz76zz68z9z72zz71zz70zi&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience prospecting into mid-market or enterprise accounts in Japan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-998806775783476394039247 author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;Preferred industries of expertise: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-998806775783476394039247 author-d-16z86ztz122z98z81zz82zz85zunv3z82zpqfnlan30z80z2wz89zz87zd3z77zz76zz72zz83ziz77zz69zpz82zvlm61m6g&quot;&gt;construction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-998806775783476394039247 author-d-iz88z86z86za0dz67zz78zz78zz74zz68zjz80zz71z9iz90z9z84zhz75z1z69z2z67zz75zq4z65zudz69zz81z4z89zhz66zrz89zu8vkwz71zz78zfr&quot;&gt;, media, technology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience engaging IT, Security, Compliance, Operations, Procurement, or Line-of-Business stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Familiarity with SaaS, cloud collaboration, content management, productivity tools, or AI-enabled workplace solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;Experience supporting account-based sales motions, partner motions, field events, or executive engagement campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qovw8w7fz78zz76zz85z3z83zz85zqz85zpz74ziz66zaz82zsz73zz80z0z85zz81zz79zrpp4z69z&quot;&gt;General understanding of enterprise software buying processes, including multi-stakeholder evaluation and procurement cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z7z65z9wz73z7z75z6emz81zz70z4oz65zrz86z4dnz72ztz67zvoz67zl91&quot;&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
